### 1. Dang ky
POST http://localhost:8005/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Nguyen Van A",
  "email": "student@example.com",
  "password": "123456",
  "images": null
}

### 2. Dang nhap - copy token trong response
POST http://localhost:8005/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student@example.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 3. Ho so - thay YOUR_TOKEN
GET http://localhost:8005/users/me
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN

### 4. Danh sach nguoi dung - thay YOUR_TOKEN
GET http://localhost:8005/users
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN
